{"seq":2,"slug":"environmental-risk-assessment","title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 环境风险评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/biosafety/environmental-risk-assessment","wordCount":2235,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-农业生物技术-环境风险评估\">研究生 农业生物技术 — 环境风险评估</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>转基因生物的环境风险评估（Environmental Risk Assessment, ERA）是在转基因产品环境释放和商业化种植前，系统评价其对生态环境可能产生不利影响的科学过程。ERA遵循&quot;个案分析、逐步推进、科学评价&quot;的基本原则，从实验室封闭试验到中间试验、环境释放试验和生产性试验，逐步放大评价规模和生态暴露水平，为监管决策提供科学依据。</p>\n<p>核心评估维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基因流（Gene Flow）</strong>：转基因通过花粉传播向野生近缘种或传统作物转移的概率和后果</li>\n<li><strong>非靶标生物效应（Non-target Organism Effects）</strong>：转基因产物对非害虫物种的毒理和生态影响</li>\n<li><strong>靶标害虫抗性演化（Target Pest Resistance Evolution）</strong>：害虫种群对转基因杀虫蛋白产生适应性的风险</li>\n<li><strong>土壤生态系统影响</strong>：转基因作物根系分泌物和残体降解对土壤微生物群落的影响</li>\n<li><strong>持久性与入侵性（Persistence and Invasiveness）</strong>：转基因作物在非农业生境中自生和扩散的潜力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"环境风险评估方法学\">环境风险评估方法学</h3><p>ERA遵循国际通行的&quot;问题构建→暴露评估→危害鉴定→风险表征&quot;四步法框架：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[问题构建 Problem Formulation] --&gt; B[危害鉴定 Hazard Identification]&#10;    A --&gt; C[暴露评估 Exposure Assessment]&#10;    B --&gt; D[风险表征 Risk Characterization]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E{风险可接受?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[批准/附条件批准]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[拒绝/要求追加数据]&#10;    D --&gt; H[风险管理措施建议]\">graph TD\n    A[问题构建 Problem Formulation] --&gt; B[危害鉴定 Hazard Identification]\n    A --&gt; C[暴露评估 Exposure Assessment]\n    B --&gt; D[风险表征 Risk Characterization]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E{风险可接受?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[批准/附条件批准]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[拒绝/要求追加数据]\n    D --&gt; H[风险管理措施建议]</pre><p><strong>问题构建</strong>是ERA最关键的第一步，需要明确三个要素：评估终点（Assessment Endpoint，即需要保护的生态实体或生态功能）、测量终点（Measurement Endpoint，可实验测定的指标）和概念模型（暴露路径和因果链）。</p>\n<p>以Bt玉米对非靶标鳞翅目昆虫的ERA为例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>评估终点：农田及周边栖息地中非靶标蝶类种群的可持续性</li>\n<li>测量终点：帝王蝶（<em>Danaus plexippus</em>）幼虫对Bt花粉暴露后的存活率和生长指标</li>\n<li>概念模型：Bt玉米花粉→风力扩散→沉降于马利筋叶面→帝王蝶幼虫取食→Cry蛋白暴露</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"基因流风险评估\">基因流风险评估</h3><p>基因流评估关注两个维度：<strong>发生概率</strong>和<strong>生态后果</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>花粉介导基因流的定量模型</strong>：花粉浓度随距离的衰减通常符合负指数或幂律模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(d) = C_0 \\cdot e^{-\\lambda d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>或</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(d) = C_0 \\cdot d^{-\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为距源田距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 处的花粉浓度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为源强度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为衰减参数。</p>\n<p>实际测量表明，大多数作物的异交率在距源田 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> m外降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0.1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1%</span></span></span></span></span>。但零星长距离花粉传播事件仍然存在，距离可达数千米。</p>\n<p><strong>基因流后果评估</strong>需考虑：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情景</th>\n<th>风险等级</th>\n<th>关键条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>转基因→传统作物</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>影响有机认证和贸易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转基因→野生近缘种（无适合度优势）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>转基因在野生群体中中性漂变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转基因→野生近缘种（赋予适合度优势）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>如耐除草剂基因流入杂草性近缘种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转基因→无近缘种存在</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>如转基因大豆在中国（非起源中心）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>油菜（<em>Brassica napus</em>）是基因流风险最受关注的转基因作物之一，因其：花粉产量大、种子二次休眠特性强、与多个近缘种（<em>B. rapa</em>, <em>B. juncea</em>等）可自然杂交。加拿大实际调查已发现多起耐除草剂性状在油菜自生苗中叠加的案例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"非靶标生物影响评估\">非靶标生物影响评估</h3><p>非靶标生物评估的核心挑战在于确定适当的测试物种和暴露场景。分层评估策略（Tiered Approach）是国际通行方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tier 1（实验室高剂量暴露）</strong>：使用纯化的Bt蛋白以最大暴露量（通常为田间预期暴露量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 倍）喂饲指示物种。若无显著效应，风险评估结束</li>\n<li><strong>Tier 2（实验室实际暴露）</strong>：使用转基因植物组织（叶片、花粉）在更接近田间的暴露条件下测试</li>\n<li><strong>Tier 3（半田间试验）</strong>：笼罩或微宇宙实验</li>\n<li><strong>Tier 4（田间大规模监测）</strong>：商业化种植区域的长期生态监测</li>\n</ul>\n<p>重要案例——<strong>帝王蝶争议</strong>：1999年Losey等人在<em>Nature</em>上发表的实验室研究显示，高浓度Bt玉米花粉（Event 176）对帝王蝶幼虫有致死效应。这一发现引发了广泛公众关注。随后的多机构协作研究（Sears et al., 2001）通过定量风险分析证明，在田间实际暴露条件下，帝王蝶种群的风险极低：Event 176品种已退出市场，主流Bt品种（Mon810, Bt11）的花粉毒性远低于实验室高剂量场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"靶标害虫抗性管理\">靶标害虫抗性管理</h3><p>害虫对Bt蛋白抗性演化是转基因作物长期可持续利用面临的最大生态风险。抗性演化速率取决于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>初始抗性等位基因频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>转基因性状的表达剂量（高剂量vs低剂量）</li>\n<li>庇护所（Refuge）的大小和空间配置</li>\n<li>害虫的迁飞行为和交配模式</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>高剂量/庇护所策略</strong>（High-Dose/Refuge Strategy）是延缓抗性演化的主要管理工具。其核心假设：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Bt蛋白表达量（高剂量）足以杀死 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>99.99</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;99.99\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.99%</span></span></span></span></span> 的敏感型纯合子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>）和杂合子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>）个体</li>\n<li>抗性为隐性遗传——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 杂合子在高剂量下不能存活</li>\n<li>庇护所提供足够数量的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 个体，使存活的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 个体在随机交配中主要与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 个体交配，产生的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 后代被高剂量杀灭</li>\n</ol>\n<p>在此策略下，抗性等位基因频率的每代变化近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>≈</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta q \\approx q^2 \\cdot s \\cdot (1-r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 为抗性等位基因频率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 为选择系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为庇护所比例。当庇护所比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 足够大时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 维持在极低水平。</p>\n<p>然而，已有多个国家报道了田间Bt抗性案例，包括美国的棉铃虫（<em>Helicoverpa zea</em>）对Cry1Ac的抗性和南非的茎螟（<em>Busseola fusca</em>）对Cry1Ab的抗性。这些案例中，抗性多为非完全隐性遗传或庇护所不足所致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生态监测与上市后评估\">生态监测与上市后评估</h3><p>除上市前ERA外，许多国家要求转基因作物商业化后开展持续的生态监测（Post-Market Environmental Monitoring, PMEM）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>个案特异性监测（Case-specific Monitoring）</strong>：针对ERA中识别的特定不确定性，设计监测方案进行验证</li>\n<li><strong>一般性监测（General Surveillance）</strong>：通过现有农业监测网络检测ERA未预见的不良环境效应</li>\n</ul>\n<p>欧盟对所有批准的转基因产品均要求提交年度监测报告。中国则通过区域试验站网络对转基因棉花的靶标和非靶标害虫种群动态进行长期监测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>以你熟悉的一种转基因作物为例，完整构建其ERA的问题构建框架，包括评估终点、测量终点和概念模型。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>分析花粉介导基因流评估中，实验室花粉活力测试和田间异交率测定各自的优势和局限。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论分层评估方法（Tiered Approach）在非靶标生物影响评估中的科学合理性和实践意义。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某国拟批准一种抗虫转基因水稻的商业化种植，该水稻与野生稻（<em>Oryza rufipogon</em>）在种植区存在同域分布。请设计该转基因水稻的基因流风险评估方案。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>高剂量/庇护所策略在中国Bt棉花上的实施效果如何？分析中国棉铃虫和盲蝽蟓种群动态变化的原因。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>EFSA ERA指南</strong>：EFSA Panel on GMO (2010) &quot;Guidance on the Environmental Risk Assessment of Genetically Modified Plants&quot; <em>EFSA Journal</em></li>\n<li><strong>基因流综述</strong>：Ellstrand (2014) &quot;Is Gene Flow the Most Important Evolutionary Force in Plants?&quot; <em>American Journal of Botany</em></li>\n<li><strong>帝王蝶案例</strong>：Sears et al. (2001) &quot;Impact of Bt Corn Pollen on Monarch Butterfly Populations: A Risk Assessment&quot; <em>PNAS</em></li>\n<li><strong>抗性管理</strong>：Tabashnik &amp; Carrière (2017) &quot;Surge in Insect Resistance to Transgenic Crops and Prospects for Sustainability&quot; <em>Nature Biotechnology</em></li>\n<li><strong>中国实践</strong>：Wu et al. (2008) &quot;Suppression of Cotton Bollworm in Multiple Crops in China in Areas with Bt Toxin-Containing Cotton&quot; <em>Science</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>转基因生物环境风险评估是一个融合生态学、遗传学、毒理学和风险分析方法论的跨学科领域。从基因流定量模型到非靶标生物分层评估，从靶标害虫抗性演化预测到上市后生态监测，ERA为转基因作物的安全管理提供了系统的科学工具。掌握ERA的方法学框架和关键评估技术，理解ERA结论的不确定性和局限性，是农业生物技术研究者参与安全评价和政策讨论的必备能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 环境风险评估","id":"研究生-农业生物技术-环境风险评估"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"环境风险评估方法学","id":"环境风险评估方法学"},{"level":3,"text":"基因流风险评估","id":"基因流风险评估"},{"level":3,"text":"非靶标生物影响评估","id":"非靶标生物影响评估"},{"level":3,"text":"靶标害虫抗性管理","id":"靶标害虫抗性管理"},{"level":3,"text":"生态监测与上市后评估","id":"生态监测与上市后评估"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 转基因生物安全监管","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/biosafety/gmo-regulation"},"next":{"title":"研究生 农业生物技术 — 农业生物伦理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/agricultural-biotechnology/biosafety/bioethics-agriculture"}}